@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title Proposed — Session lifecycle and separate credential scopes
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

[*] --> Establishing : required proofs + current eligibility
Establishing --> Active : actual fresh session committed
Establishing --> Refused : missing / invalid / unavailable required evidence
Active --> Active : permitted activity under actual lifetime policy
Active --> Expired : actual selected idle / absolute rule reached
Active --> Revoked : logout / applicable reset / suspension / explicit invalidation
Expired --> [*]
Revoked --> [*]
Refused --> [*]
note right of Active
 Rotation/renewal, if selected, creates or rebinds context
 under the actual invalidation policy, not immortal refresh.
 No numeric lifetime, JWT or OAuth refresh token adopted.
end note
note bottom of Revoked
 Report completion only at actual server-side invalidation boundary.
 Old restored state must not reactivate revoked sessions.
 Provider and Git credentials have separate scope/lifecycle.
end note

@enduml